cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "Phoenix SDR-DSP: Windows-Native DSP, SDR, and PQC Experiments for AMD Phoenix XDNA1"
abstract: "A native Windows 11 engineering corpus for deterministic DSP, SDR, transform, and FIPS-aligned post-quantum cryptography experiments on AMD Ryzen AI Phoenix silicon (XDNA1 / AIE2). The 34-invocation regression matrix completed 34/34 PASS on 2026-08-17: 29 direct-hardware entries, four host/NPU composer entries, and one intentional CPU reference entry. M33a/M33b are native ML-DSA primitive gates; M32e and M33d/e remain host-orchestrated rather than fully device-resident. FIPS 203 end-to-end composition coverage is currently ML-KEM-512."
type: software
